  = implemented: added a five-second directive-ledger poll while the workbench is mounted
  = implemented: queried GET /alienhand/refinement/directives after the latest known directive sequence
  = implemented: refreshed the full workbench state when remote directive events appear
  = implemented: exposed visible sync status for remote events and resolver wait states
  = implemented: cleared the poll timer when the workbench unmounts
  = implemented: expanded the runtime proof bundle markers to require directive sync visible states
  = satisfies: DataDrivenDesign evidence flow because open clients synchronize from the append-only directive ledger instead of guessing from final row state
  = satisfies: UIInteractionSpecification state visibility because the workbench reports whether sync saw remote events or is waiting on the resolver
  = satisfies: SJS justification discipline because this note maps the implementation slice to the specification contract and verification evidence
